un phrase identifying the target>\",\n+  \"clarifications_needed\": [\"<question if ambiguous>\"]\n+}\n+\n+Action types by class:\n+QUERY → READ_FILE, LIST, ANALYZE, QUERY\n+DECISION → PLAN, ANALYZE\n+EXECUTION → DEPLOY, ROLLBACK, BACKUP, RESTORE, WRITE_FILE, DELETE_FILE, RUN_COMMAND, RUN_SCRIPT, STAGE, MUTATE\n+ESCALATION → ESCALATE\n+\n+If the input is ambiguous (multiple interpretations possible), populates clarifications_needed\n+with specific questions to disambiguate. Otherwise leave it empty.\"\"\"\n \n \n class ClarificationRequired(Exception):\n-    def __init__(self, session_id: UUID, ambiguity_score: float) -> None:\n+    def __init__(self, session_id: UUID, ambiguity_score: float, questions: list[str] | None = None) -> None:\n         self.session_id = session_id\n         self.ambiguity_score = ambiguity_score\n-        super().__init__(f\"Ambiguity score {ambiguity_score:.2f} exceeds threshold\")\n+        self.questions = questions or []\n+        msg = f\"Ambiguity score {ambiguity_score:.2f} exceeds threshold\"\n+        if self.questions:\n+            msg += f\"; questions: {'; '.join(self.questions)}\"\n+        super().__init__(msg)\n \n \n # Stage 1: rule-based pre-filter (confidence=1.0, ambiguity=0.0)\n@@ -39,10 +81,8 @@ def _rule_classify(raw_input: str) -> tuple[IntentClass, str, float, float] | No\n \n \n def _extract_entity(raw_input: str) -> tuple[str, str]:\n-    # Minimal entity extraction for v0 — returns the noun phrase after the verb\n     tokens = raw_input.strip().split()\n-    entity_id = tokens[1] if len(tokens) > 1 else \"unknown\"\n-    # Crude class heuristic\n+    entity_id = \" \".join(tokens[1:]) if len(tokens) > 1 else \"unknown\"\n     entity_class_hints = {\n         \"model\": \"ML_MODEL\", \"service\": \"SERVICE\", \"db\": \"DATABASE\",\n         \"database\": \"DATABASE\", \"cluster\": \"CLUSTER\", \"file\": \"FILE\","}},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqv8yriu_f95fea7d37f9":{"observation":{"concepts":["subagent lifecycle management","process termination"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["The subagent process was explicitly halted using the subagent_stop hook.","Timestamp: 2026-06-26T18:11:01.134Z"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mqv8yriu_f95fea7d37f9","importance":1,"narrative":"The subagent execution reached a termination point as triggered by the subagent_stop hook. This indicates the completion or manual interruption of a subagent's task cycle.","sessionId":"8a12ce37-9817-49dc-8990-dd863ab7acf0","subtitle":"Subagent process stopped via subagent_stop hook","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:11:01.134Z","title":"Subagent execution terminated","type":"other"},"type":"compressed"}}␀␀␀�␀4x��